 "behaviour_contract": "Preserve delayed rider-contact counters reloaded from follow_id, automatic jump offsets (-3 or knife -4), and jump_time12. Crumble link countdown, param lifetime, follow-enable flag and world1 blink/deactivation are distinct. Spring follow_id is an amplitude that is consumed/reset; first-bounce suppression differs from manual button release. Small and large springs have different velocity boosts. On/off and boss platforms explicitly detach Rayman; no single main/substate label applies across these platform types."
